  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4202.06 “Electronic record” means “electronic record” as defined in RSA 294-E:2, VII namely, “a record created, generated, sent, communicated, received, or stored by electronic means”.\n\nSource. #9375, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10025, eff 11-16-11, EXPIRED: 11-16-19\n\nNew. #13019, eff 4-7-20",
